    <h1>Electrician Lead Costs: CPL, Qualified Leads and Booked Estimates</h1>
    <p class="lf-lede">Cost per lead is a starting metric. Electrical contractors should evaluate qualified inquiries, confirmed estimates, completed jobs and the contribution margins behind those outcomes.</p>
